SUMMARY:Digital Meetup: Systems at Play
DESCRIPTION:Create glitch portraits\, map satellite landscapes and explor
 e generative visuals. Free entry\, no booking required\; workshop places
  go on arrival.\nPrice: Free\nhttps://www.vam.ac.uk/event/lgoA8EBgJE/dig
